# --- Sold-Out Gap Calculator — environment variables ---

# Google Apps Script Web App URL.
# Used to capture lead form submissions into a Google Sheet
# AND email the user their forecast.
#
# How to get this URL: see docs/REPORT_CAPTURE_SETUP.md
#
# If you leave this blank, the "Send My Report" form will run
# in demo mode (no data captured, no email sent).
VITE_REPORT_ENDPOINT_URL=

# --- Sold-Out Stage Diagnostic V0 ---

# Google Apps Script Web App URL for the Stage Diagnostic.
# Each submission becomes one new row in your Diagnostics Google Sheet.
#
# How to get this URL: see docs/DIAGNOSTIC_SETUP.md
#
# If you leave this blank, the diagnostic runs in demo mode
# (the form works and shows the confirmation, but nothing is saved).
#
# The Sold-Out Snapshot Generator (/snapshot) also reuses this same URL to
# optionally pull recent submissions into the internal builder. If it's blank,
# the builder simply runs in manual-entry mode.
VITE_DIAGNOSTIC_ENDPOINT_URL=
